{"seq":3,"slug":"pattern-matching","title":"模式匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-programming/algebraic-types/pattern-matching","wordCount":906,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"模式匹配\">模式匹配</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>模式匹配</strong>是对代数数据类型做分支处理的核心机制。它比 <code>switch/case</code> 多出三样东西：<strong>解构绑定</strong>、<strong>嵌套匹配</strong>和编译器的<strong>穷尽检查</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解构绑定</td>\n<td>匹配的同时把内部数据绑定到变量</td>\n<td>无需手动逐层取值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>穷尽检查</td>\n<td>编译器验证所有变体都被处理</td>\n<td>新增变体立即报错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套匹配</td>\n<td>任意深度的结构匹配</td>\n<td>一次处理复杂结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>守卫条件</td>\n<td>在模式之上附加布尔条件</td>\n<td>表达范围与特例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模式种类</td>\n<td>字面量 / 变量 / 通配符 / 构造器 / As</td>\n<td>覆盖各类匹配需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>模式匹配把&quot;数据的形状&quot;直接写成代码的形状：数据是什么结构，代码就长什么样，遗漏分支会被编译器当场抓住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模式匹配概述\">模式匹配概述</h2><p><strong>模式匹配</strong>（Pattern Matching）是函数式编程中对代数数据类型进行分支处理的核心机制。它不仅仅是增强版的 <code>switch</code>——模式匹配可以解构数据、绑定变量，且编译器可以验证所有情况是否被穷尽处理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"data Shape = Circle Double | Rectangle Double Double | Triangle Double Double Double&#10;&#10;area :: Shape -&gt; Double&#10;area (Circle r)        = pi * r * r&#10;area (Rectangle w h)   = w * h&#10;area (Triangle a b c)  = let s = (a + b + c) / 2&#10;                          in sqrt (s * (s-a) * (s-b) * (s-c))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data Shape = Circle Double | Rectangle Double Double | Triangle Double Double Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>area :: Shape -> Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>area (Circle r)        = pi * r * r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>area (Rectangle w h)   = w * h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>area (Triangle a b c)  = let s = (a + b + c) / 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                          in sqrt (s * (s-a) * (s-b) * (s-c))</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"enum Shape {&#10;    Circle(f64),&#10;    Rectangle(f64, f64),&#10;    Triangle(f64, f64, f64),&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn area(shape: &amp;Shape) -&gt; f64 {&#10;    match shape {&#10;        Shape::Circle(r) =&gt; std::f64::consts::PI * r * r,&#10;        Shape::Rectangle(w, h) =&gt; w * h,&#10;        Shape::Triangle(a, b, c) =&gt; {&#10;            let s = (a + b + c) / 2.0;&#10;            (s * (s - a) * (s - b) * (s - c)).sqrt()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>enum Shape {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Circle(f64),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Rectangle(f64, f64),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Triangle(f64, f64, f64),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn area(shape: &#x26;Shape) -> f64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match shape {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Shape::Circle(r) => std::f64::consts::PI * r * r,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Shape::Rectangle(w, h) => w * h,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Shape::Triangle(a, b, c) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let s = (a + b + c) / 2.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            (s * (s - a) * (s - b) * (s - c)).sqrt()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>switch/case</th>\n<th>模式匹配</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解构绑定</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅ 自动绑定变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>穷尽检查</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅ 编译器强制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套匹配</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅ 任意深度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>守卫条件</td>\n<td>需要 if/else</td>\n<td>✅ 原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配值类型</td>\n<td>相等比较</td>\n<td>结构匹配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    VALUE[&quot;值&quot;] --&gt; MATCH[&quot;模式匹配&quot;]&#10;    MATCH --&gt;|&quot;模式 1&quot;| R1[&quot;解构 + 绑定 → 表达式 1&quot;]&#10;    MATCH --&gt;|&quot;模式 2&quot;| R2[&quot;解构 + 绑定 → 表达式 2&quot;]&#10;    MATCH --&gt;|&quot;模式 3&quot;| R3[&quot;解构 + 绑定 → 表达式 3&quot;]&#10;    MATCH --&gt;|&quot;穷尽检查 ✓&quot;| SAFE[&quot;编译通过&quot;]\">graph TD\n    VALUE[\"值\"] --&gt; MATCH[\"模式匹配\"]\n    MATCH --&gt;|\"模式 1\"| R1[\"解构 + 绑定 → 表达式 1\"]\n    MATCH --&gt;|\"模式 2\"| R2[\"解构 + 绑定 → 表达式 2\"]\n    MATCH --&gt;|\"模式 3\"| R3[\"解构 + 绑定 → 表达式 3\"]\n    MATCH --&gt;|\"穷尽检查 ✓\"| SAFE[\"编译通过\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 模式匹配的穷尽检查（Exhaustiveness Check）是编译器的安全网。当你添加一个新的变体到和类型时，编译器会标记所有未处理新变体的 match 表达式，确保你不会遗漏任何分支。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"模式的种类\">模式的种类</h2><p>模式匹配支持多种模式形式，从简单的字面量到复杂的嵌套结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"-- 字面量模式&#10;describe :: Int -&gt; String&#10;describe 0 = &quot;zero&quot;&#10;describe 1 = &quot;one&quot;&#10;describe _ = &quot;other&quot;&#10;&#10;-- 构造器模式&#10;unwrap :: Maybe a -&gt; a -&gt; a&#10;unwrap (Just x) _ = x&#10;unwrap Nothing  d = d&#10;&#10;-- 元组模式&#10;fst :: (a, b) -&gt; a&#10;fst (x, _) = x&#10;&#10;-- 列表模式&#10;head :: [a] -&gt; Maybe a&#10;head []    = Nothing&#10;head (x:_) = Just x&#10;&#10;-- 嵌套模式&#10;deepMatch :: Maybe (Either String Int) -&gt; String&#10;deepMatch (Just (Right n)) = show n&#10;deepMatch (Just (Left s))  = s&#10;deepMatch Nothing          = &quot;empty&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- 字面量模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe :: Int -> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe 0 = \"zero\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe 1 = \"one\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>describe _ = \"other\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 构造器模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwrap :: Maybe a -> a -> a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwrap (Just x) _ = x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwrap Nothing  d = d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 元组模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fst :: (a, b) -> a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fst (x, _) = x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 列表模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>head :: [a] -> Maybe a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>head []    = Nothing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>head (x:_) = Just x</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- 嵌套模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deepMatch :: Maybe (Either String Int) -> String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deepMatch (Just (Right n)) = show n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deepMatch (Just (Left s))  = s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>deepMatch Nothing          = \"empty\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式种类</th>\n<th>语法示例（Haskell）</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字面量</td>\n<td><code>0</code>, <code>&quot;hello&quot;</code>, <code>True</code></td>\n<td>匹配具体值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变量</td>\n<td><code>x</code>, <code>name</code></td>\n<td>绑定任意值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通配符</td>\n<td><code>_</code></td>\n<td>匹配任意值但不绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构造器</td>\n<td><code>Just x</code>, <code>Left e</code></td>\n<td>匹配并解构代数类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元组</td>\n<td><code>(a, b, c)</code></td>\n<td>解构元组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列表</td>\n<td><code>[]</code>, <code>(x:xs)</code></td>\n<td>解构列表头尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套</td>\n<td><code>Just (Right n)</code></td>\n<td>深层结构匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>As 模式</td>\n<td><code>all@(x:xs)</code></td>\n<td>绑定整体同时解构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rust-中的模式匹配\">Rust 中的模式匹配</h2><p>Rust 拥有最强大的模式匹配系统之一，<code>match</code> 表达式必须穷尽所有可能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn describe_number(n: i32) -&gt; &amp;&#39;static str {&#10;    match n {&#10;        0 =&gt; &quot;zero&quot;,&#10;        1..=9 =&gt; &quot;single digit&quot;,&#10;        10..=99 =&gt; &quot;double digit&quot;,&#10;        _ =&gt; &quot;large number&quot;,&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn process_result(r: Result&lt;i32, String&gt;) -&gt; String {&#10;    match r {&#10;        Ok(n) if n &gt; 0 =&gt; format!(&quot;positive: {n}&quot;),&#10;        Ok(0) =&gt; &quot;zero&quot;.to_string(),&#10;        Ok(n) =&gt; format!(&quot;negative: {n}&quot;),&#10;        Err(e) =&gt; format!(&quot;error: {e}&quot;),&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct Point { x: f64, y: f64 }&#10;&#10;fn classify_point(p: &amp;Point) -&gt; &amp;&#39;static str {&#10;    match p {&#10;        Point { x: 0.0, y: 0.0 } =&gt; &quot;origin&quot;,&#10;        Point { x, y: 0.0 } =&gt; &quot;on x-axis&quot;,&#10;        Point { x: 0.0, y } =&gt; &quot;on y-axis&quot;,&#10;        _ =&gt; &quot;other&quot;,&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn describe_number(n: i32) -> &#x26;'static str {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match n {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        0 => \"zero\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        1..=9 => \"single digit\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        10..=99 => \"double digit\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _ => \"large number\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn process_result(r: Result&#x3C;i32, String>) -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match r {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(n) if n > 0 => format!(\"positive: {n}\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(0) => \"zero\".to_string(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(n) => format!(\"negative: {n}\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(e) => format!(\"error: {e}\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Point { x: f64, y: f64 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn classify_point(p: &#x26;Point) -> &#x26;'static str {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match p {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Point { x: 0.0, y: 0.0 } => \"origin\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Point { x, y: 0.0 } => \"on x-axis\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Point { x: 0.0, y } => \"on y-axis\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _ => \"other\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;Rust match 表达式&quot;&#10;        V[&quot;Result&amp;lt;i32, String&amp;gt;&quot;] --&gt; M[&quot;match&quot;]&#10;        M --&gt;|&quot;Ok(n) if n &gt; 0&quot;| P[&quot;positive&quot;]&#10;        M --&gt;|&quot;Ok(0)&quot;| Z[&quot;zero&quot;]&#10;        M --&gt;|&quot;Ok(n)&quot;| N[&quot;negative&quot;]&#10;        M --&gt;|&quot;Err(e)&quot;| E[&quot;error&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"Rust match 表达式\"\n        V[\"Result&amp;lt;i32, String&amp;gt;\"] --&gt; M[\"match\"]\n        M --&gt;|\"Ok(n) if n &gt; 0\"| P[\"positive\"]\n        M --&gt;|\"Ok(0)\"| Z[\"zero\"]\n        M --&gt;|\"Ok(n)\"| N[\"negative\"]\n        M --&gt;|\"Err(e)\"| E[\"error\"]\n    end</pre><p>Rust 模式匹配的独特特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>范围模式</td>\n<td>匹配数值范围</td>\n<td><code>1..=9</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>守卫</td>\n<td>附加条件</td>\n<td><code>Ok(n) if n &gt; 0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绑定</td>\n<td>匹配同时绑定值</td>\n<td><code>n @ 1..=9</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用模式</td>\n<td>匹配引用</td>\n<td><code>&amp;x</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解构</td>\n<td>结构体/元组解构</td>\n<td><code>Point { x, y }</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Or 模式</td>\n<td>多模式合并</td>\n<td><code>1 | 2 | 3</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Rust 编译器的穷尽检查是类型安全的重要保障。如果你在 enum 中添加新变体而忘记更新 match 表达式，编译器会直接报错——这在大型重构中尤其有价值。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"typescript-中的模式匹配\">TypeScript 中的模式匹配</h2><p>TypeScript 没有原生模式匹配，但可以通过类型收窄和 <code>switch</code> 模拟：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Shape =&#10;  | { kind: &#39;circle&#39;; radius: number }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;rectangle&#39;; width: number; height: number }&#10;  | { kind: &#39;triangle&#39;; sides: [number, number, number] };&#10;&#10;const area = (shape: Shape): number =&gt; {&#10;  switch (shape.kind) {&#10;    case &#39;circle&#39;:&#10;      return Math.PI * shape.radius ** 2;&#10;    case &#39;rectangle&#39;:&#10;      return shape.width * shape.height;&#10;    case &#39;triangle&#39;: {&#10;      const [a, b, c] = shape.sides;&#10;      const s = (a + b + c) / 2;&#10;      return Math.sqrt(s * (s - a) * (s - b) * (s - c));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;};&#10;&#10;const exhaustiveCheck = (x: never): never =&gt; {&#10;  throw new Error(`Unhandled case: ${x}`);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Shape</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'circle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">radius</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rectangle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'triangle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sides</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> area</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">shape</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Shape</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"col